","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-24T11:32:54Z","updated_at":"2024-10-24T11:32:54Z","body":"@dustdfg Absolutely! While Godot's splash screen offers more customization options, having two splash screens feels like a significant drawback to me. The [Android splash screen](https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/launch/splash-screen) also provides some customization options. You can set your adaptive foreground and background in Godot export settings to update the icon and background color. Additionally, with Gradle build, you can incorporate custom animated icons and branding images.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2435026767/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2435029635","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98484#issuecomment-2435029635","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98484","id":2435029635,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RI5qD","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-24T11:34:25Z","updated_at":"2024-10-24T11:38:01Z","body":"I meant that maybe it is better to provider user a choice which splash screen to use?\r\n\r\nEDIT: if it is even possible. I've heard about android that sometimes it loves to be an iron fist. And say: \"From today you have this feature and you can't disble it\"","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2435029635/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2435042723","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98484#issuecomment-2435042723","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98484","id":2435042723,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RI82j","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-24T11:41:12Z","updated_at":"2024-10-24T11:41:12Z","body":"They’ve done the same with this as well. Unfortunately, we don’t have a choice, and there’s no way to remove the Android splash screen.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2435042723/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2435252608","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98484#issuecomment-2435252608","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98484","id":2435252608,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RJwGA","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-24T13:08:25Z","updated_at":"2024-10-24T13:08:25Z","body":"Android API - Docs: https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/launch/splash-screen\r\nI'm not yet sure what effects it has on **Android 12 and 13**, has anyone tested it yet?\r\n\r\n--------------\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n#if !defined(TOOLS_ENABLED) && (defined(WEB_ENABLED) || defined(ANDROID_ENABLED))\r\n\tbool show_logo = false;\r\n```\r\nPR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/92965  -> Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/69317, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/62863, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/74348 \r\nno more now?\r\n\r\n\r\nI think it was also about the project settings (For example the “Duration” setting / \"Display time\")\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7ba01441-6e3c-494d-8ff0-3e39ee3f8c3e)\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2435252608/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2435344527","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98484#issuecomment-2435344527","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98484","id":2435344527,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RKGiP","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-24T13:45:59Z","updated_at":"2024-10-24T13:45:59Z","body":"@Alex2782 I have tested it with `Android 14` and its working as intended.\r\n\r\n> #if !defined(TOOLS_ENABLED) && (defined(WEB_ENABLED) || defined(ANDROID_ENABLED))\r\n> \tbool show_logo = false;\r\n> PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/92965 -> Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/69317, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/62863, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/74348\r\n> no more now?\r\n\r\nAFAIK, this wasn't causing the black screen problem, and actual fix was to _install the new SplashScreen API_ which is still used.\r\nRemoving `defined(ANDROID_ENABLED)` was needed to the show logo on Godot's splash.\r\n\r\nAnd Duration time is also not affected and will now work with the android splash (I have tested it).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2435344527/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2435529015","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98484#issuecomment-2435529015","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98484","id":2435529015,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RKzk3","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-24T14:54:57Z","updated_at":"2024-10-24T14:54:57Z","body":"This is intended behavior. We want the Godot splash screen on Android to provide consistency between platforms. And given the restrictions imposed by Android, we cannot remove the default Android splash screen, as such the intended behavior is to have both splash screens.\r\n\r\nIf the developer does not want the Godot splash screen, they can disable it themselves from the project settings.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2435529015/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2435540328","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98484#issuecomment-2435540328","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98484","id":2435540328,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RK2Vo","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-24T14:59:33Z","updated_at":"2024-10-24T14:59:33Z","body":"TLDR; the Godot's splash screen takes priority. If you find a mean to disable the Android splash screen while remaining consistent with Android's guidelines, that may be an option (and PR) worth looking at.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2435540328/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2435566913","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98484#issuecomment-2435566913","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98484","id":2435566913,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RK81B","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-24T15:10:14Z","updated_at":"2024-10-24T15:11:53Z","body":"@m4gr3d I agree that \"Godot's splash screen takes priority\". But having two splash screens seems like an issue.\r\n\r\n> If the developer does not want the Godot splash screen, they can disable it themselves from the project settings.\r\n\r\nHow can i disable that? If I toggle off \"show Image\" it still shows a black screen(splash bg color) after `Android Splash` for some time.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2435566913/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2435622988","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98484#issuecomment-2435622988","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98484","id":2435622988,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RLKhM","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-24T15:34:03Z","updated_at":"2024-10-24T15:34:03Z","body":"> How can i disable that? If I toggle off \"show Image\" it still shows a black screen(splash bg color) after Android Splash for some time.\r\n\r\nGood point. \r\nI may be okay with keeping the second part of your PR which allows to keep the Android splash screen until the main loop has started. Though in order to make this customizable, the configuration would need to be being an export setting so it can be read in `onCreate` (the project settings are not available until after `onGodotSetupCompleted`).\r\n\r\n> find a mean to disable the Android splash screen while remaining consistent with Android's guidelines\r\n\r\nI'll also reach out to Google to see if this is possible. This should be the ideal way to go if this was possible.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2435622988/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]